      "cooked": "<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://www.handelabra.com/blog/2023/12/20/handelabra-games-year-in-review-2023\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b81597e71d2809097cd9a35663c22cb5d0a8ec2a.png\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://www.handelabra.com/blog/2023/12/20/handelabra-games-year-in-review-2023\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Handelabra Games</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:690/388;\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cfa90d9ffae1d56fbb8fa82bd6c4fd37aef1c88b_2_690x388.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cfa90d9ffae1d56fbb8fa82bd6c4fd37aef1c88b_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cfa90d9ffae1d56fbb8fa82bd6c4fd37aef1c88b_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cfa90d9ffae1d56fbb8fa82bd6c4fd37aef1c88b_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/c/cfa90d9ffae1d56fbb8fa82bd6c4fd37aef1c88b_2_10x10.png\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.handelabra.com/blog/2023/12/20/handelabra-games-year-in-review-2023\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Handelabra Games Year in Review 2023 — Handelabra Games</a></h3>\n\n  <p>The  preparations made in 2022  came to fruition in 2023, as we released 2 new games, 2 expansions, and more. We're not resting on our laurels now - there's much more to come in 2024.</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
