      "username": "Thunderbird",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2023-12-23T14:41:59.065Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hoo boy… Already sunk over 2000 hours into Enhanced Edition Digital. Think I can break my record with this? Still enjoying physical Definitive Edition, but it reaches the table far too infrequently and it’s hard to hype up others for it as much as I am. This should make solo game setup infinitely easier and take care of all the bookkeeping that’s probably my biggest gripe with the tabletop game.</p>",
