    {
      "id": 255973,
      "name": "",
      "username": "Thunderbird",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2023-12-24T02:05:05.649Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m sure I’ll go all in for digital, but will probably still buy up all the physical DE sets since I was a late adopter and didn’t get EE other than the video game.</p>\n<p>Also, you gotta figure development starting in 2024 means Digital DE sometime in 2025 at the earliest. Even if <em>Disparation</em> takes 16(ish) months from funding to fulfillment, you’re still looking at about a 4 year difference in release of core SotM DE to the digital. I just want some more new content to keep me busy in the meantime.</p>",
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2023-12-24T02:05:05.649Z",
