      "id": 256463,
      "name": "Hankroyd",
      "username": "Hankroyd",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/cc9497/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2024-01-18T19:22:28.820Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m so happy !!!</p>\n<p>I love to play DE but I don’t have much time. I guess I played it twice last year.<br>\nHaving the digital version would be excellent.<br>\nI guess after all this years it will e time to say goodbye the the first SotM digital soon™</p>\n<p>I don’t care if it came for the 10th anniversary, early 2025 or late 2025. I want the best possible.</p>\n<p>I’m realy curious about how they will implement events.</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-01-18T19:22:28.820Z",
      "reply_count": 1,
