      "username": "MigrantP",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
      "created_at": "2024-01-23T16:04:25.147Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Glad to hear everyone is excited - so are we!</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"OddballPaladin\" data-post=\"9\" data-topic=\"30398\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/d26b3c/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> OddballPaladin:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>given that (to my understanding) Vengeance was that much of a pain for them, with having to almost redo the whole engine.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Vengeance existed when we started implementing Sentinels digital, so it was already planned for; we didn’t have to redo anything. It was a lot of work of course, with lots of content and new UI layouts required, etc.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Hankroyd\" data-post=\"11\" data-topic=\"30398\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/h/cc9497/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Hankroyd:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’m realy curious about how they will implement events.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>We have some exciting ideas! <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grinning.png?v=12\" title=\":grinning:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grinning:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2024-01-23T16:04:25.147Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": 11,
